    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d402">

                <pb facs="0481" n="469" sameAs="frus:frus1944v03/pg469"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 EW/9–1544</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Department of State to
                        the Greek Embassy
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Reference is made to the memorandum of the Royal Greek Embassy dated September
                    15, 1944,<anchor n="16" xml:id="d402-f1"/> requesting that the American
                    representatives charged with presenting the armistice terms to Bulgaria be
                    instructed to maintain close contact with the diplomatic representatives of the
                    Greek Government at the place chosen for the armistice discussions.</p>
                <p>The Department of State will have in mind the Embassy’s request when, following
                    the determination of the place and time for the presentation of the armistice
                    terms for Bulgaria, instructions are sent to its representative regarding his
                    participation in the presentation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1944-10-21">October 21,
                            1944</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
